  "preview": "My Claude limits ran out on Wednesday last week. They are weekly limits, and they normally reset on Sunday, so from Wednesday onwards there was not that much I could actually do. After that came denia",
  "text": "My Claude limits ran out on Wednesday last week. They are weekly limits, and they normally reset on Sunday, so from Wednesday onwards there was not that much I could actually do.\n\nAfter that came denial, anger, bargaining, the full set of stages. 🙃\n\nAnd then I thought, listen, maybe 𝘁𝗵𝗶𝘀 𝗶𝘀 𝗻𝗼𝘁 𝗮 𝗯𝘂𝗴, 𝗶𝘁 𝗶𝘀 𝗮 𝗳𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲. AI pushes me personally, and I see the whole world around me working so intensively right now that there is no time to rest even a little.\n\nSo maybe these limits are turning out to be more useful than harmful. 🙂\n\nPS. A good thing AI might bring is a 3-day workweek. Hopefully.",
